cff-version: 1.2.0
title: The Masonry Archive
message: >-
  If you use images, records or metadata from this archive, please cite it
  using the metadata below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Castellazzi
    given-names: Giovanni
    affiliation: >-
      Department of Civil, Chemical, Environmental and Materials Engineering
      (DICAM), University of Bologna
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5870-5474
repository-code: https://github.com/gcastellazzi/theMasonryArchive
url: https://gcastellazzi.github.io/theMasonryArchive/
abstract: >-
  An open, moderated archive of geolocated photographs of masonry structures,
  with construction metadata for teaching and research on the mechanics and
  documentation of historical masonry.
keywords:
  - masonry
  - historical structures
  - built heritage
  - structural documentation
  - geolocated photographs
  - open data
license: CC-BY-4.0
